Human: Can you tell me the steps to write an if/then statement in C programming language?

Assistant: Sure!  An "if/then" statement is one of the simplest if statements you'll come across in C.  Here's an example:

if (x > 0) {
  // do something here
} else if (x == 0) {
  // do something else here
} else {
  // do something else here
}
